Coordinate comments and input on regulatory changes and submit them to the relevant stakeholder.
Conduct rules management activities to ensure that adequate risk measures and standards are in place to safeguard the domestic RTGS operations.
Review and align settlement and scheme rules with new products or services introduced by the SAMOS operator.
Stay abreast of current developments to contribute to the division’s strategy and ensure their application, including changes to policies, rules, regulations, legislation and systems.
Compile reports for management review on governance, compliance, operational performance and decision-making.
